    - target: {fileID: 4407943790353120084, guid: 5566b590cb47e2d47b961c3d2f92df9b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: " Photos taken throughout the events of the Streynian War. \r\n1: Scenes
        from a riot where the police were dispatched. This marks one of the first
        incidents of rising tensions between the people of Streynia.\r\n2: Debate
        between the then Prime Minister (Thebrean) and the opposition party leader
        running the elections against him (Eskani).\r\n3: One of the few incidents
        of a peaceful protest during these times. This protest was heralded by people
        asking for ceasefires and equal rights.\r\n4: An abandoned child holding
        onto their plush toy as they watch their hometown erupting into flames.\r\n5:
        A close-up shot of the bomb blasting aftermath in the now-destroyed Cleoni
        city, in the central part of the country by the river.\r\n6: Multiple people
        boarding planes to escape the war-torn nation to seek refuge and safety elsewhere.\r\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
